Hi Dan,

Thanks for the tips. I got the files into R and rasterized them. I've been able to calculate patch and class metrics in SDMTools as a couple people suggested, but I still haven't figured out a way to calculate metrics that describe entire landscapes with multiple land cover classes (like interspersion and contagion) in R.

Cheers,
Jesse

Jesse E. D. Miller
Botanist - Ecologist
Postdoctoral Researcher
Department of Environmental Science and Policy
University of California-Davis
http://jesseedmiller.com

