Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Elsie,
Have your tried any tree based methods like gbm, random forest, or xgboost? I'm not familiar with the method maxent uses. Could try multiple approaches (up and down sampling) for each method and compare?
Thanks,
Katie

